Z||000013||qwikgta||02-12-2001||08:01 PM||||Just figured I'd add my .02 cents.  I made my own as well.  Just cut and weld your own, or get one from a junker.  I also made a new center piece because i didn't like the way the boot looked with the short shifter.  You can see it at my website.<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR>QWIKGTA<BR>88 T-Top coupe<BR>http://robsfieroproject.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||10
