Z||000015||TheFiero64||02-14-2001||02:42 PM||||I also have one of FieroDave's shifters. I do have Rodney's leather shift boot though. I've never seen a product from Rodney that was anything but top notch. I have several now. I love the decklid strut.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||10
