Z||000017||frontal lobe||02-16-2001||01:05 AM||||Yeah, what was up with GM for putting in such a tall shifter?  Does anyone know the story behind that.  All the time I've spent on the forum, and I've never seen anyone say.  If it was any taller, ALL the Fiero's would have had to have sunroofs.||||reg||1
